stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Staged
    Staged --> Canary : promote 5% of the fleet
    Canary --> Rollout : the error rate stays under 1%
    Canary --> RollingBack : the error rate passes 1%
    Rollout --> Live : every shard runs the new build
    RollingBack --> Staged : the previous build is back
    Live --> [*]
